{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2021-07-30 13:25:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT TO SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "NEW ORLEANS, JULY 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ENTERGY CORPORATION (NYSE: ETR) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $0.95 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 1, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF AUGUST 12, 2021."}